<title>POLAND: LUBAWA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.50 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.58 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Sales		    2.98 vs   2.09</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.51 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.35 vs   0.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.78 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Sales		    9.20 vs   9.45</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical garment maker is</p>
<p>Zaklady Odziezy Technicznej Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
